WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:13.760
It’s project time! Make 2–3 animals march in a ScratchJr parade using repeats with chunks, add grow or shrink for showing off, and start them all with the green flag.

2
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:20.170
Animals march across the screen in a parade.

3
00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:25.140
Each one has its own dance chunk.

4
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:30.640
Give each animal a chunk (like right, hop) inside a repeat.

5
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.860
Make one animal grow and shrink as it marches — it’s showing off!

6
00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.740
Every animal starts on the green flag.

7
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:45.090
March to the star: right, hop — 4 times — then grow to take a bow!

8
00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:49.610
Stomp, hop, stomp, hop… and a big bow!

9
00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.930
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:58.210
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
